        "version": "v1",
        "text": "Your catalogue lists packaging supplies."
      },
      {
        "id": "JM1",
        "ref": "F1",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "御社の商品案内には包装用品が掲載されています。"
      },
      {
        "id": "M2",
        "ref": "H1",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "You may be interested in materials that fold for storage; this is an unconfirmed hypothesis about your needs."
      },
      {
        "id": "JM2",
        "ref": "H1",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "折りたたんで保管する資材に関心をお持ちかもしれませんが、御社のニーズについての未確認の仮説です。"
      },
      {
        "id": "M3",
        "ref": "C1",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "We can introduce an overview of our foldable dividers."
      },
      {
        "id": "JM3",
        "ref": "C1",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "当社の折りたたみ仕切り材の概要をご紹介できます。"
      },
      {
        "id": "M4",
        "ref": "U1",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "Order quantities and supply availability remain to be confirmed."
