        "version": "v1",
        "text": "注文数量と供給可否は、引き続き確認が必要です。"
      },
      {
        "id": "M5",
        "ref": "U2",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "We will advise on delivery timing after checking the quantity and specifications; no immediate dispatch or arrival date is promised."
      },
      {
        "id": "JM5",
        "ref": "U2",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "数量と仕様を確認してから納期をお知らせします。即時出荷や到着日は約束していません。"
      },
      {
        "id": "M6",
        "ref": "U3",
        "version": "v1",
        "text": "Pricing and shipping charges remain to be confirmed."
